    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_510 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∃ (c : ℝ) (hc : 0 < c),\n      ∀ᶠ N in atTop, ∀ (A : Finset ℕ), 0 ∉ A → #A = N →\n      ∃ θ, ∑ n ∈ A, cos (n * θ) < -c * sqrt N",
